<title>SWITZERLAND: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>SWITZERLAND GOVERNMENT LIST (961204)</p>
<p> President.................................Arnold KOLLER (CDP)</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Justice)</p>
<p>		NOTE: The Presidency rotates among the seven</p>
<p>			ministers in the Federal Council on an</p>
<p>			annual basis.</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>FEDERAL COUNCIL (FOUR-PARTY COALITION GOVERNMENT)</p>
<p>HEADS OF FEDERAL DEPARTMENTS (MINISTERS):</p>
<p> Defence........................................Adolf OGI (PP)</p>
<p> Economy...........................Jean-Pascal DELAMURAZ (RDP)</p>
<p> Finance.................................Kaspar VILLIGER (RDP)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs............................Flavio COTTI (CDP)</p>
<p> Justice.........................................See President</p>
<p> Social &amp; Interior.........................Ruth DREIFUSS (SDP)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Energy...................Moritz LEUENBERGER (SDP)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank President..........................Markus LUSSER</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>CDP -- Christian Democratic Party</p>
<p>PP  -- People's Party</p>
<p>RDP -- Radical Democratic Party</p>
<p>SDP -- Social Democratic Party</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			    (End Government List)</p>
</text>
